---
import Container from "../common/Container.astro";
---
<section id="why-me" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-border py-20 md:py-28 reveal">
  <Container maxWidth="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="reveal-child mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Why Me?</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">Your brand, but make it relatable.</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/60">Creating the kind of content that makes someone stop scrolling, lean in, and think, “Okay, I need that.”</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal-child mx-auto mt-12 max-w-2xl border-t border-border pt-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/65" style="--reveal-delay: 140ms">
      <p>I love the little details that make a product worth talking about, but even more than that, I love finding a way to share them that feels real.</p>
      <p class="mt-5">I'm naturally curious, a little chatty, and always finding something new to try, recommend, or tell someone about. I bring that same energy into my content — whether I'm talking directly to the camera, telling a story through a voiceover, or showing a product in action.</p>
      <p class="mt-5">My approach is simple: make content people actually enjoy watching, while giving them a reason to care about the product.</p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
